  <!-- EN: rosner -->
  <OE_Rosner.label>罗斯纳</OE_Rosner.label>
  <!-- EN: An Obsidia giant mammal with giant horn, domesticated in ancient times for fur, meat and milk. Rosner are peaceful creatures that can be tamed. But at the same time, they are very easy to enrage if you attack them. Once angered, its massive strength and sharp horn make it a brutal opponent. -->
  <OE_Rosner.description>一种黑曜石巨型哺乳动物，长有巨大的角，古代被驯化以获取毛皮、肉类和牛奶。罗斯纳是可驯服的温顺生物。但与此同时，如果你攻击它们，它们很容易被激怒。一旦被激怒，其巨大的力量和锋利的角使它成为残酷的对手。</OE_Rosner.description>
